{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a private hybrid setup connecting your data center to Jakarta VPC via Express Connect, with MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Jakarta region","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"req","text":"No public internet exposure for databases"}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","mongodb","rds","privatezone"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"On-premises data center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"onprem-dc","label":"SaaS application servers","group":"onprem","why":"Runs the SaaS platform entirely on-premises."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Private DB VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"ec","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect","group":"vpc","why":"Dedicated private link from data center to VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-ec","from":"app","to":"ec","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongo","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Document store reachable only over private network."}
{"t":"node","id":"pg","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational store reachable only over private network."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-mongo","from":"ec","to":"mongo","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-pg","from":"ec","to":"pg","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","attachTo":"vpc","why":"Resolves database endpoints privately inside the VPC."}
{"t":"done","summary":"On-premises app servers connect via Express Connect to a private Jakarta VPC hosting managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL with no internet exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming platform with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing traffic before ESA, then ALB to app servers and cache."}
{"t":"req","text":"Anti-DDoS Proxy must sit in front of ESA"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","anti-ddos-proxy","esa","alb","waf","ecs","tair","live","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"Audience watching live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves platform domain to Anti-DDoS Proxy."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubs large L3-L7 attacks before ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-ddos","from":"users","to":"ddos","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates dynamic content and caches static assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-esa","from":"ddos","to":"esa","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes traffic across app servers."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs streaming platform logic in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps sessions and metadata fast for viewers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and delivers live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"streams"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Media storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores recordings, thumbnails and static assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"recordings"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logs and security alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming architecture: Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubs traffic into ESA, then ALB with WAF routes to ECS app servers backed by Tair cache."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading company docs from OSS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Deploy in Frankfurt region","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","oss","milvus","rds","tair","sls","acr","nat","eip"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Company staff asking the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the assistant domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes employee HTTPS traffic into the cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the Kubernetes cluster hosting Dify."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ack","why":"Self-hosted low-code agent and RAG builder for the assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches Dify sessions and conversation state."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Dify metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores Dify workflows, users and app metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus vector store","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds document embeddings for RAG retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-vector","from":"ack","to":"vector","label":"gRPC"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Gives private pods outbound access to Model Studio."}
{"t":"node","id":"eip","product":"eip","label":"EIP","group":"vpc","attachTo":"nat","why":"Public IP for NAT egress to external APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","label":"SNAT"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores custom Dify container images for ACK pulls."}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Company documents","group":"frankfurt","why":"Source bucket holding internal PDFs and files."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-docs","from":"ack","to":"docs","label":"S3 API"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"frankfurt","why":"Provides Qwen model API for Dify LLM calls."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-nat-llm","from":"nat","to":"llm","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Collects Dify and ACK logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt with RDS, Tair, Milvus, OSS documents and Qwen via Model Studio."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata, OSS for images, and ESA for delivery."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions allowed","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"People uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates image delivery and protects the origin."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes API traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend on ECS."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales ECS instances with traffic load."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app","label":"API"}
{"t":"say","text":"Metadata goes to RDS and uploaded images are stored in OSS, served back through ESA."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data and photo metadata reliably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Photo storage","group":"sg","why":"Holds all uploaded images durably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"fetch"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects application logs for troubleshooting."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend with ESA, ALB, ECS with Auto Scaling, RDS for metadata and OSS for images, no serverless."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Tair queue and a dedicated ECS worker pool to generate thumbnails from OSS events, avoiding serverless."}
{"t":"node","id":"queue","product":"rocketmq","label":"Thumbnail jobs","group":"vpc","why":"Receives OSS upload events and queues thumbnail jobs for workers."}
{"t":"node","id":"thumb-worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Consumes queued jobs and writes resized thumbnails back to OSS."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-images-queue","from":"images","to":"queue","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-queue-thumb-worker","from":"queue","to":"thumb-worker","label":"consume","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-thumb-worker-images","from":"thumb-worker","to":"images","label":"write thumbs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added RocketMQ and ECS thumbnail workers to auto-generate thumbnails on upload without serverless functions."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a product catalog API with ALB, SAE compute, RDS database, Tair cache, and OSS for images, avoiding Elasticsearch."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Elasticsearch due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","cloud-native-api-gateway","sae","rds","tair","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace users","group":"internet","why":"Browsers and apps querying the product catalog."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves marketplace domain to ESA edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates API responses and caches product images at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes inbound traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the API from OWASP attacks and bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes, throttles and authenticates catalog API calls."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"sae","label":"Catalog API","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Serverless containers running the product catalog service."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-api","from":"gateway","to":"api"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding the data layer: Tair for fast lookups, RDS for durable storage, and OSS for product images."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Product cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product listings to reduce DB load."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Catalog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores products, categories and pricing durably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product photos served through ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-images","from":"api","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects API access logs and error traces."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API on SAE behind ESA, ALB with WAF, API Gateway, Tair cache, RDS database and OSS image storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add OpenSearch for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles, keeping Elasticsearch banned per your legal team."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Elasticsearch due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"opensearch","label":"Product search","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-search","from":"api","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added OpenSearch behind the Catalog API for full-text and fuzzy product search, respecting the Elasticsearch ban."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB, WAF, ECS compute, RDS database and OSS document storage."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","cloud-backup","kms"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"Insurance customers submitting claims and documents."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the claims portal domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates portal access and caches static assets for policyholders."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes portal traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the claims portal from web attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the claims portal application in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during peak claim periods."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claim records with high availability standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"Stores policyholder document submissions securely in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"Centralized logging and audit trail for compliance."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Backup","group":"tokyo","why":"Disaster recovery for databases and documents."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-backup","from":"db","to":"backup","kind":"async"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-backup","from":"docs","to":"backup","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"tokyo","why":"Encrypts stored documents and database backups at rest."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB+WAF, ECS, RDS, OSS, SLS, Cloud Backup and KMS for data residency compliance."}

{"t":"say","text":"Policyholder data must stay in Tokyo per your regulation, so I cannot replicate the claims database to Singapore."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, I'll add a read replica in Tokyo and a Quick BI dashboard for your analytics team to access securely."}
{"t":"node","id":"db-replica","product":"rds","label":"Analytics read replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Tokyo-only read replica for reporting without moving data out of Japan."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-db-replica","from":"db","to":"db-replica","label":"replication","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"bi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Reporting dashboards","group":"tokyo","why":"Analytics dashboards querying the Tokyo read replica only."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-bi-db-replica","from":"bi","to":"db-replica","label":"SQL reads"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a Tokyo read replica and Quick BI dashboards; data stays in Japan per regulatory requirement."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal. Model Studio runs in Tokyo, so all data stays in Japan."}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen chatbot","group":"tokyo","why":"Answers policyholder questions using Qwen models hosted in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-llm","from":"app","to":"llm","label":"API"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Model Studio in Tokyo for the Qwen chatbot; the portal servers call it via API, keeping all data in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 데이터와 워크로드를 서울(ap-northeast-2) 리전에 배치하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보 해외 반출 금지, 서울 리전만 사용","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"플레이어","group":"internet","why":"게임에 접속하는 이용자들"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"게임 도메인을 ESA로 해석"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"엣지","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"정적 자산 캐싱 및 DDoS 방어"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"seoul","kind":"region","label":"서울 (ap-northeast-2)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"게임 VPC","parent":"seoul"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역으로 트래픽 분산"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"웹 공격 및 봇 차단"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"game-server","product":"ecs","label":"게임 서버","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역에서 게임 로직 처리"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"game-server","why":"접속자 수에 따라 서버 자동 증감"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-game-server","from":"alb","to":"game-server"}
{"t":"say","text":"세션은 Tair에, 플레이어 데이터는 RDS에 저장하며 모두 이중 가용영역으로 구성합니다."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"세션 캐시","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"게임 세션과 랭킹을 빠르게 제공"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"플레이어 DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"개인정보 포함 플레이어 데이터를 서울에만 저장"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-cache","from":"game-server","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-db","from":"game-server","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"게임 에셋 스토리지","group":"seoul","why":"패치 파일 및 미디어를 서울에 보관"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"assets"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"로그 서비스","group":"seoul","why":"서버 로그 수집 및 모니터링"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-game-server-logs","from":"game-server","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"서울 리전 단일 구성으로 ESA, ALB(WAF), ECS 게임 서버, Tair, RDS를 배치하여 개인정보 해외 반출을 방지했습니다."}

